            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Many do, but not all, and the listing does not always say. Of the treadmills we read on 28 November 2026, the SOLE F50, F65 and F80, the Horizon 7.4 AT and several THERUN, ANCHEER and FUNMILY models named a built-in fan; the ProForm Carbon and NordicTrack T Series listings we read did not. Check the title, bullets and maker spec sheet.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "What is the best treadmill with a fan?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "For most people, the SOLE F65: a 20 by 60-inch deck, 0.5 to 12 mph, 0&ndash;15% incline, 350 lb capacity and a crossflow cooling fan, at $1,199.99 on Amazon on 28 November 2026. The cheapest we found was the THERUN 15% Auto Incline Treadmill at about $387.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Is a treadmill console fan enough to keep you cool?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Usually only on easy walks in a cool room. A console fan is small and aimed at your face and chest from close range, so it cools little of your body and only moves the room&rsquo;s own air. For jogging, running or long incline walks, add a floor or pedestal fan in front of the treadmill.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Does the ProForm Carbon TLX have a fan?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Its Amazon listing, which we read on 28 November 2026, does not mention a fan in the title or bullets, and proform.com blocked our requests that day, so we could not confirm one. If a fan matters, ask ProForm or the seller before you buy, or choose a model whose listing names one.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "What is a crossflow fan on a treadmill?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "It is the drum-shaped type of fan used in many tower fans, blowing out of a wide slot rather than a round grille. SOLE names a crossflow fan on the F65 and F80, which spreads air across your upper body more evenly than a small round fan. SOLE does not publish an airflow figure.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "Can I add a fan to a treadmill that does not have one?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "Yes. A clip-on or magnetic fan attaches to the console or handrail, and a floor or pedestal fan in front of the treadmill moves far more air than any built-in fan. Keep cords away from the deck and the treadmill&rsquo;s plug. Our best treadmill fans guide compares the options.",
          },
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      headline: title,
      description: description,
      author: { "@type": "Person", "@id": "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/editorial-standards/#shaheer-ali-khan", name: "Shaheer Ali Khan", honorificSuffix: "PhD", jobTitle: "Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist", url: "https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/editorial-standards/#who", sameAs: ["https://www.linkedin.com/in/shaheer-ali-khan-data/"], worksFor: { "@type": "Organization", name: "Treadmill Reviews USA" } },
      datePublished: "2026-11-28",
      dateModified: "2026-11-28",
      publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: "Treadmill Reviews USA" },
    },
    ...PRODUCTS.map((product) => ({
      "@type": "Product",
      name: product.name,
      description: product.description,
      ...(product.brand ? { brand: { "@type": "Brand", name: product.brand } } : {}),
      ...(product.image ? { image: product.image.url } : {}),
      ...(product.priceBounds
        ? {
            offers: {
              "@type": "AggregateOffer",
              priceCurrency: "USD",
              lowPrice: product.priceBounds.low,
              highPrice: product.priceBounds.high,
              ...(product.amazonUrl ? { url: product.amazonUrl } : {}),
            },
          }
        : {}),
    })),
    {
      "@type": "ItemList",
      name: title,
      numberOfItems: 7,
      itemListElement: PRODUCTS.map((product, index) => ({
        "@type": "ListItem",
        position: index + 1,
        name: product.name,
        url: `https://www.treadmillreviewsusa.com/best-treadmills-with-fan/#${product.id}`,
      })),
    },
  ],
};

// "More in" links: the other pages in this article's hub group.
const HERE = "/best-treadmills-with-fan/";
const HUB = SECTIONS.find((s) => s.slug === "best");
const GROUP = HUB?.groups.find((g) => g.pages.some((p) => p.url === HERE)) ?? HUB?.groups[0];
const GROUP_PAGES = GROUP?.pages ?? [];
const HERE_AT = GROUP_PAGES.findIndex((p) => p.url === HERE);
// The group's first 2 pages (its leads), then the pages after this one, wrapping round, so every page in a long
// hub group gets sibling links and the leads keep theirs (PLAYBOOK §0b L1).
const MORE = [...new Set([...GROUP_PAGES.slice(0, 2), ...GROUP_PAGES.slice(HERE_AT + 1), ...GROUP_PAGES.slice(0, Math.max(HERE_AT, 0))])].filter((p) => p.url !== HERE).slice(0, 6);
